  "description": "Audit-grade EF Core storage for GM.KYC — the IKycAuditStore implementation backing verification attempts, submitted-document references, results, and raw vendor responses. KycDbContext derives from GM.EntityFramework.Persistence's GenericDbContext (audit conventions). The store is a thin seam intended to forward to GM.Audit once it exists, rather than owning a second parallel audit trail. Register with AddGMKyc().AddIdentomat().AddKycPersistence(...).",
